  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-11T21:21:43.929Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently when the client fails to retrieve an announcement correctly, it displays the message bellow. It should not do this. I would get in trouble at my job if our app had an error message that displayed that. Even just having Lorem Ipsum would be better. I ask that the message be changed to something along the lines of \"The announcement we tried to retrieve failed to load! Sorry about that!\"",
